{
  "workflowId": "300000327004233",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_MATERIAL_EXPIRATION_WORKFLOW_TYPE",
  "name": "Material Expiration Agent",
  "description": "This Agent\n- finds the item lots that are nearing their expiration \n- finds the demand and supply details of the lots within and across organizations\n- Supports the material movement to Quarantine Subinventory\n- Supports the creation of Interorganization transfer\n- Genrated recommendations to take actions on expiring lots.",
  "specification": {
    "jsonSchemaName": "Workflow.spec",
    "jsonSchemaVersion": "1",
    "inputs": [],
    "outputSpecification": " ",
    "agentsValueMappings": [],
    "dataPipeline": {
      "pipelineNodes": [
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Start of data pipeline",
            "name": "Start"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770860754738"
          },
          "code": "START",
          "id": "start",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "START"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "End of data pipeline",
            "name": "End"
          },
          "outcomes": {},
          "code": "END",
          "id": "end",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "END"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Intent Classifier"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769116573496"
          },
          "code": "MEINTENTCLASSIFIER",
          "id": "1769115430304",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769115430305_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Based on the following prompt: \" {{$context.$variables.UserQuery}} \", classify the LATEST user intent into the following:\nfind_expiring_or_expired_lots (this can be about enquired recommendations of expired lots)\ncheck_on_hand_balance\nview_demand_and_supply\nview_demand_accross_organizations\ncreate_movement_request\ncreate_interorganization_transfer\ncheck_disposal_policy\nrecommendation  (This is for only expiring lots and not expired lots)\n\nNOTE: If the user's latest intention is to ask for a recommendation for EXPIRING lots and not EXPIRED lots only then classify the intent as recommendation.\nNOTE: If the user's latest intention is to ask for disposal policy, then classify the intent as check_disposal_policy."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"Intent\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Route Intent"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "view_demand_and_supply": "1769638123684",
            "view_demand_accross_organizations": "1769636343843",
            "create_interorganization_transfer": "1769198305884",
            "check_disposal_policy": "1769208109709",
            "check_on_hand_balance": "1769530406064",
            "create_movement_request": "1769207461008",
            "find_expiring_or_expired_lots": "1769452263895",
            "recommendation": "1769712174323"
          },
          "code": "MEINTENTROUTER",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1769116573496",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769116573496_1",
              "name": "caseExpression",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.MEINTENTCLASSIFIER.$output.Intent}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SWITCH"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Check Item from Lot Advisor"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "true": "1769628275361",
            "false": "1769472125850"
          },
          "code": "MEVERIFYITEM",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1769115430304",
          "id": "1769192946434",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769192946436_1",
              "name": "condition",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_ITEM_NUMBER.$output.ItemNumber == '' || $context.$variables.OrganizationId == '' || $context.$variables.OrganizationId == null}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "CONDITION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract Input Variables"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771874189516"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_INPUT_VARIABLES",
          "id": "1769198305884",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769198305887_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Based on the following prompt: \" {{$context.$variables.UserQuery}} \", \n1. Extract the value of the following variables:\nShipmenNumber\nItemNumber(Required)\nItemRevision\nUOM (Required)\nTransactionDate (If the value is not mentioned, please set today's date.)\nSourceOrganization(Required,  won't be the same as Destination Organization)\nSourceSubinventoryCode(Required)\nDestinationOrganization (Required)\nDestinationSubinventory\nLotNumber (Required)\nTransactionQuantity (Required)\n\n2. Extract the serial numbers, the serial numbers are a range; please validate that the second value is greater than the first one and that the range is consistent with the quantity. Then set the variable FmSerialNumber (value identified as the start of the range) and ToSerialNumber (value identified as the end of the range). if the quantity is one, the unique serial number found should be set in both properties.\nIf the value of variable 'FmSerialNumber' and variable 'ToSerialNumber' is diferent than empty then set the valiable 'SerialNumbers' concatenating the following values '{\"FmSerialNumber:\" '  + FmSerialNumber = '\",\"ToSerialNumber\":'  + ToSerialNumber + '\"} ' \n\n3. List the required attributes that are missing with a readable name, if there one or more attributes listed. create a text explaning to the user this values are missing and are required, concatenate the list of attributes and assign this value to 'Error' variable."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"SourceOrganization\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ShipmenNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ItemNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ItemRevision\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"UOM\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"TransactionDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"SourceSubinventoryCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"DestinationOrganization\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"DestinationSubinventory\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"LotNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"TransactionQuantity\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"SerialNumbers\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"FmSerialNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ToSerialNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"Error\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Valid Attributes?"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "true": "1769198526308",
            "false": "1769698619181"
          },
          "code": "VALID_ATTRIBUTES",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1769198372027",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769198372029_1",
              "name": "condition",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_INPUT_VARIABLES.$output.Error == ''}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "CONDITION"
        },
